comments.body:
@participant5 Thanks for reporting this. We have seen this issue appear by one other user with the current version and I created an issue on that yesterday in the upstream library here: https://github.com/glideapps/glide-data-grid/issues/941

Unfortunately, we don't have an example yet that allows us to reproduce this issue consistently. Would it be possible for you to share your code? 

Do you use `use_container_width=True` with those dataframes? We believe the issue is connected to this feature; turning it to False might resolve it. Can you check this in your app? And you are using the normal layout or? not the wide layout?
